  "created": "2026-06-21T14:20:00.177Z",
  "description": "Headless WebKitGTK-based HTML to PDF renderer for .NET. Drop-in API-compatible with CobaltPDF (the Chromium-based one) - same C# API, same fluent methods, same CobaltEngine type. 96% lower idle memory than Chromium and 57% faster on warm renders. On Linux the library auto-provisions a portable WebKit bundle on first use - no Docker, no apt, no system setup - so the same NuGet works on Azure App Service Linux, Azure Container Apps, AKS, ECS, and any Ubuntu/Alpine container.",
  "id": "CobaltPDF.WebKit",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-06-21T14:22:36.707Z",
